    - 330 Hz \* 1 Hz
    - 220 Hz \* 2 Hz
    - 330 Hz \* 2 Hz
  - By replacing the carrier sinusoid with a more complex sound, ring modulation can even be used as a general purpose audio _effect_, to add tremolo to any existing sound
